+
+    With the @daily schedule the run for day D has logical date D and fires
+    at D+1 00:00 UTC, once the day is complete. Backfills and
+    `airflow dags test orders_daily_load D` use logical date D too, and
+    clears and retries keep it, so they always reprocess the same day.
+    """
+    return pendulum.instance(context["logical_date"]).in_tz("UTC").to_date_string()
+
